# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/alienbeacon.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"Our investigation of the signal from the planet's surface brought us to "
"what\n"
"seems to be an alien beacon. Based on the rock formation around the beacon, "
"it\n"
"was probably left here millions of years ago.\n"
"\n"
"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ld2SzK\n"
"\n"
"Written by Otavio Good; 2014.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Unsere Untersuchung des Signals von der Planetenoberfläche brachte uns zu "
"dem, was\n"
"scheint ein außerirdisches Leuchtfeuer zu sein. Basierend auf der "
"Felsformation rund um das Leuchtfeuer ist es\n"
"wurde wahrscheinlich vor Millionen von Jahren hier zurückgelassen.\n"
"\n"
"https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ld2SzK\n"
"\n"
"Geschrieben von Otavio Good; 2014.\n"
"  "

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:1
msgid "Amiga Juggler"
msgstr "Amiga-Jongleur"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Eine Echtzeit-Nachbildung von Eric Grahams Amiga-Demo „Juggler“ von 1987: "
"ein GLSL\n"
"Port seines rekursiven Raytracers. Der Roboter, die Bälle, das Schachbrett\n"
"Der Boden und die Spiegelreflexionen werden alle prozedural generiert und "
"per Raytrace verfolgt.\n"
"\n"
"Geschrieben von Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

