#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"This screen saver was removed from the XScreenSaver distribution as of\n"
"version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"A cellular automaton that is really a two-dimensional Turing machine:\n"
"as the heads (\"ants\") walk along the screen, they change pixel\n"
"values in their path.  Then, as they pass over changed pixels, their\n"
"behavior is influenced.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Written by David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dieser Bildschirmschoner wurde aus der XScreenSaver-Distribution entfernt\n"
"Version 4.22.\n"
"\n"
"Ein zellulärer Automat, der eigentlich eine zweidimensionale Turing-Maschine "
"ist:\n"
"Wenn die Köpfe („Ameisen“) über den Bildschirm laufen, ändern sie die Pixel\n"
"Werte auf ihrem Weg.  Wenn sie dann über veränderte Pixel laufen, werden "
"ihre\n"
"Verhalten wird beeinflusst.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Langton%27s_ant\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turing_machine\n"
"\n"
"Geschrieben von David Bagley; 1997.\n"
"  "

