msgid ""
"\n"
"The symptoms most commonly produced by Enrichment Center testing are\n"
"superstition, perceiving inanimate objects as alive, and hallucinations.\n"
"The Enrichment Center reminds you that the weighted companion cube will\n"
"never threaten to stab you and, in fact, cannot speak.  In the event that\n"
"the Weighted Companion Cube does speak, the Enrichment Center urges you to\n"
"disregard its advice.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portal_%28video_game%29\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2011.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Drohe niemals, dich zu erstechen, und kann tatsächlich nicht sprechen.  Für "
"den Fall, dass\n"
"Die Symptome, die am häufigsten durch Tests im Enrichment Center "
"hervorgerufen werden, sind:\n"
"Der Weighted Companion Cube spricht, das Enrichment Center fordert Sie dazu "
"auf\n"
"Aberglaube, die Wahrnehmung unbelebter Objekte als lebendig und "
"Halluzinationen.\n"
"seinen Rat missachten.Das Enrichment Center erinnert Sie daran, dass der "
"gewichtete Begleitwürfel dies tut\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portal_%28video_game%29\n"
"\n"
"Geschrieben von Jamie Zawinski; 2011.\n"
"  "

